      <p class="/snippets/technology-preview.md">To maintain infrastructure flexibility while using existing virtualization layers, you can deploy {"{"}{"{"} hcp {"}"}{"}"} on non-bare-metal Agent machines. You can use the management benefits of the Agent platform when running on virtualized environments or other cloud-based virtual machines.</p>
      <p>You can deploy {"{"}{"{"} hcp {"}"}{"}"} by configuring a cluster to function as a hosting cluster. The hosting cluster is an OpenShift Container Platform cluster where the control planes are hosted. The hosting cluster is also known as the management cluster.</p>
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
